at's going on on YouTube  but number one membership you can sign  up at david pakman.com slash membership  if you want a 40 percent discount you  can use the code I voted 17 number to  make a pledge at patreon.com slash david  pakman show even if it's only $1 a month  you can do that at patreon.com slash  david pakman show number three if you  ever shop on amazon.com go to david  pakman.com slash amazon before you shop  number four if you have youtube red  which is ten bucks a month to watch  youtube ad free  watch our videos because we get a cut of  that $10 fee and number five get your  gear this includes david pakman show  coffee bumper stickers and apparel at  david pakman.com slash gear good news on  patreon patreon donors are accumulating  fifteen hundred and thirty eight patrons  as of this morning it is a cumulative  process so everybody that can cover just  a dollar is more than making up for the  lost revenue on youtube because we  estimated we were making thirty to fifty  cents max from each Youtube subscriber  if they watched all hundred and sixty of  our monthly videos if you can do just a  doll or a month you're basically  covering yourself and one other person  and also good news when it comes to  membership people continue to sign up in  significantly increased numbers at david  pakman.com slash membership of course to  get that 40% discount select your  membership click the red sign up button  and then on the second page you will see  the field that says coupon code you can  type in I voted 17 there all right so  that's the latest update I'm trying to  only do an update on this like once  every couple weeks I want to remind you  it's still a problem but not spend the  entire show talking about ad pocalypse
 

